#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Visualization3D.Visualization3D:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Visualization3D.Visualization3D:5
msgid "``Point Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : taille des points."
msgstr "``Point Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : point size."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Visualization3D.Visualization3D:6
msgid "``Pixel Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : taille physique d'un pixel ; valeur par défaut : ``160`` nm."
msgstr "``Pixel Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : physical pixel size; default value: ``160`` nm."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Visualization3D.Visualization3D:7
msgid "``XY Scale`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : facteur d'échelle des axes X et Y."
msgstr "``XY Scale`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : scale factor along the X and Y axes."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Visualization3D.Visualization3D:8
msgid "``Z Scale`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : facteur d'échelle de l'axe Z."
msgstr "``Z Scale`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : scale factor along the Z axis."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Visualization3D.Visualization3D:9
msgid "``Remove Outliers`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : exclut les localisations dont l'intensité est nulle."
msgstr "``Remove Outliers`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : excludes localizations with zero intensity."

